he modal\n1438:- **Action**: User presses the Escape key\n1441:#### Test: Creating multiple issues in sequence works correctly\n1522:- **Initial state**: User is viewing cycle detail for \"Sprint 2\" with multiple issues.\n1566:#### Test: Cancel button closes the create cycle modal without creating\n1788:#### Test: Cancel button closes create project modal without creating\n1795:- **Action**: User clicks the backdrop/overlay area outside the modal\n1798:#### Test: Create project modal can be closed with Escape key\n1800:- **Action**: User presses the Escape key\n1840:- **Action**: User clicks on the project name, types \"Draft Name\", then presses Escape.\n1972:#### Test: Bulk action — change status for multiple issues\n1977:#### Test: Bulk action — change priority for multiple issues\n1982:#### Test: Bulk action — change assignee for multiple issues\n1987:#### Test: Bulk action — change label for multiple issues\n2028:- **Action**: User clicks the description to edit, types \"Changed text\", then presses Escape.\n2180:- **Action**: User clicks outside the modal (on the backdrop overlay)\n2347:- **Action**: User clicks outside the modal (on the backdrop overlay)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EN3WrwhwG5ZKWqxePVaLrZ","session_id":"54681ede-564a-4d83-857e-e1c1fbe67772","uuid":"358aba76-e38c-42b9-8eca-415b6bcf75ce"}
